              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Calixte420"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Yummy! I made it with 1/3 c sesame oil and 2/3 c vegetable oil, which gave it a bit of a nutty flavor but didn't overpower the miso. I also grated some fresh ginger into it, and have been enjoying it ever since!",
