            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "KSPILKS"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Instead of vegetable oil, I used 1/2 c of sesame oil and 1/2 c of peanut oil. I also added a few drops of toasted sesame oil, which can be quite strong so I was careful with the amount. I grated some ginger into the dressing, too. Those were the only modifications I made. Great dressing.",
            "datePublished": "2013-05-26T19:47:06.630Z"
          },
          {
