              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "BarbsBerry"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This was a good recipe. It was very close to the sushi restaurant down the street. I realized this was missing the peanut taste to my favorite dressing, so I added a 1T of peanut butter and it seemed to do the trick. I think it would have been better if it called for peanut oil instead of veggie oil and since I had already made it, the peanut butter was a quick fix. I would make it again.",
            "datePublished": "2009-03-03T15:15:41.820Z"
